---

const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="border-t border-white/5 bg-deepgray/80">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold gradient-text mb-3">夜深科技</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">
          河北省夜深科技有限责任公司<br />
          用代码重塑深夜的无限可能。
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-300 mb-3">导航</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-500">
          <li><a href="/" class="hover:text-neon-purple transition-colors">首页</a></li>
          <li><a href="/about" class="hover:text-neon-purple transition-colors">关于</a></li>
          <li><a href="/solutions" class="hover:text-neon-purple transition-colors">解决方案</a></li>
          <li><a href="/contact" class="hover:text-neon-purple transition-colors">联系</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-300 mb-3">联系信息</h4>
        <address class="not-italic text-sm text-gray-500 space-y-1">
          <p>河北省唐山市路北区龙仁里清科园</p>
          <p>Email: hello@yeshen.tech</p>
        </address>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-white/5 text-center text-xs text-gray-600">
      &copy; {currentYear} 河北省夜深科技有限责任公司. All rights reserved.
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
